OL,3,GNEWSACall for school meals to be
OL,4,Abrought back in-house
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is being urged to bring
OL,7,Fschool meals back in-house after a
OL,8,Funion said there had been a drop in
OL,9,Fquality.
OL,11,FIn March 2024 North Tyneside Council
OL,12,Fsuspended its school catering service
OL,13,Famid declining uptake and a #3m annual
OL,14,Fshortfall.
OL,16,FThere are now calls by the GMB for this
OL,17,Fto be reversed after it said there had
OL,18,Fbeen a a drop in quality and hike in
OL,19,Fprices, and a national report found
OL,20,Fmost English secondary school meals
OL,21,Ffailed to reach health standards.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
