OL,3,GNEWSACall for school meals to be
OL,4,Abrought back in-house
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the decision was
OL,7,Fnecessary due to financial pressures
OL,8,Fand it continued to work with schools
OL,9,Fto support healthy eating and ensure
OL,10,Fpupils had access to nutritious meals.
